---
import Simple from '../layouts/Simple.astro';
---
<Simple title="Privacy" seoTitle="Privacy Policy | Best Cities in Spain" description="No accounts, no newsletter, no advertising cookies from us. What Plausible Analytics and the GetYourGuide and Stay22 partner scripts do." path="/privacy/">
  <p class="lede">This site has no accounts, no forms and no newsletter. We don't set advertising cookies.</p>
  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>We use <a href="https://plausible.io/data-policy">Plausible Analytics</a> to count page views and clicks on tour links. Plausible doesn't use cookies and doesn't collect personal data. Counts are aggregated and can't identify you.</p>
  <h2>GetYourGuide</h2>
  <p>Pages load a script from GetYourGuide, our booking partner, so that bookings made through our links are credited to us and so that some pages can show a list of tours. When you click through to GetYourGuide, their <a href="https://www.getyourguide.com/privacy-policy">privacy policy</a> applies, including any cookies they set.</p>
  <h2>Stay22</h2>
  <p>Pages load a script from <a href="https://www.stay22.com/privacy">Stay22</a> that turns links to Booking.com and similar sites into affiliate links, so that bookings made through them are credited to us. When you click through, the booking site's own privacy policy applies.</p>
  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p>If you write to hello@bestcitiesinspain.com, we use your message only to reply. Mail is forwarded by Cloudflare Email Routing.</p>
  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>The site is served by Cloudflare, which processes technical data such as IP addresses to deliver pages and block attacks.</p>
</Simple>
